    "detailed_description": "Area 37 is a retro-style 16-bit platform and action game featuring pixel art, set in a post-apocalyptic world where a chip is worth more than a life. Players take on the role of Pink, a lone mercenary striving to survive in a hostile place dominated by robots and other mechanized creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478820/extras/81217ece757e09fca1cfb3ed254e071c.poster.avif?t=1734031924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478820/extras/81217ece757e09fca1cfb3ed254e071c.webm?t=1734031924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478820/extras/81217ece757e09fca1cfb3ed254e071c.mp4?t=1734031924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The story unfolds in a region known as Area 37, devastated by the consequences of wealth concentration and labor mechanization. To survive, Pink agrees to do the dirty work for corporations, undertaking perilous missions in exchange for money.<br><br>Players must employ platforming and combat skills to overcome challenges across each level, facing enormous bosses in various environments within Area 37. The retro-style 16-bit pixel art and synthesized soundtrack add a nostalgic touch to the gaming experience.<br><br>With an intriguing storyline and significant challenges, Area 37 appeals to gamers seeking action in a post-apocalyptic world, blended with a strong sense of nostalgia.<br>Pink's journey to survive and earn money in Area 37 is not a tale of heroism but rather one of self-interest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478820/extras/6eb2d7b1d157937d7513acce40414ca6.poster.avif?t=1734031924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478820/extras/6eb2d7b1d157937d7513acce40414ca6.webm?t=1734031924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478820/extras/6eb2d7b1d157937d7513acce40414ca6.mp4?t=1734031924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>-Relive the gaming experience of the '80s/'90s.<br>-Various enemies and bosses.<br>-Multiple stages in different settings.<br>-Diverse mechanics as the game progresses.",
